accommodations may be made to enable individuals with disabilities to perform the essential functions. Other Requirement Position requires on campus, face to face interactions. Position requires maintain a regular schedule of attendance on campus and in the workplace. Position requires a flexible schedule to work evening hours, as necessary. Position is contingent upon funding/need All positions are security-sensitive. Applicants are subject to a criminal history investigation, and employment is contingent upon the institution’s verification of credentials and/or other information required by the institution’s procedures, including the completion of the criminal history check. Equal Opportunity/Veterans/Disability Employer."
